@startuml sequence-upload
title Upload & Import of an Audio File

actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "uploads route" as Upload
participant "importService" as Import
participant "music-metadata" as MM
participant "artworkService" as Art
database "SQLite" as DB
collections "File system\n/data" as FS

User -> SPA : drop files on Add Music dialog
SPA -> Upload : POST /api/uploads (multipart)
Upload -> Upload : multer stores temp file
loop per file
  Upload -> Import : importAudioFile(tempPath, name)
  Import -> MM : parseFile(tempPath)
  MM --> Import : tags + embedded picture
  Import -> FS : move to music/Artist/Album/NN Title.ext
  alt embedded cover present
    Import -> Art : storeArtwork(bytes)
    Art -> FS : covers/<sha1>.jpg (deduplicated)
  else no cover
    Import -> DB : reuse artwork of same album
  end
  Import -> DB : INSERT INTO tracks
  Import --> Upload : track row
end
Upload --> SPA : per-file result list
SPA -> User : ✓ imported / ⚠ skipped / ✕ failed
@enduml
